␀Usage: %s srcfile destfile

␀      Copies any custom installation done with TINST from␀      Turbo Pascal 4.0 or 5.0 to Turbo Pascal 5.5. Especially␀      useful if you used TINST to modify the default colors or␀      editor commands in Turbo Pascal 4.0 or 5.0.
␀      srcfile  = Turbo Pascal 4.0 or 5.0 path + filename␀      destfile = Turbo Pascal 5.5 path + filename
␀    Examples:␀      tinstxfr \tp4\turbo.exe \tp\turbo.exe␀      tinstxfr a:turbo.exe turbo.exe
␀    Warning: Remember to run this program on a copy of your␀             distribution disks and not on the originals.␀/os␀.EXE␀'%s' is not a Turbo Pascal 5.5 Integrated Environment.
␀'%s' is not a Turbo Pascal 4.0 Integrated Environment.
